config BR2_PACKAGE_NEOMAGIC_DIAG
	bool "neomagic-diag"
	help
	  Standalone diagnostic for the NeoMagic MagicGraph 256ZX (NM2360)
	  BitBLT engine. Maps PCI BAR0 (framebuffer) + BAR1 (MMIO) from
	  userspace and tests solid fill, screen-to-screen blit and ROP,
	  verifying results and timing. Safe: time-bounded wait, no writes
	  outside the documented register block.